  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basel Institute Ukraine Implementation Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Ukraine&#x2019;s war and post-war resilience is bolstered by robust anti-corruption systems
 
Outcome 1: Partner government entities, state-owned enterprises (SOEs) and private companies are empowered to effectively identify, assess and mitigate corruption risks.
Outcome 2: Partner anti-corruption enforcement agencies are empowered to continue delivering high-quality and impartial investigations and prosecutions.
Outcome 3: The Basel Institute is established as a trusted and sustainable source of technical advice to partners in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
